  "operator_notes": [
    "Copy the permission block into local ignored OpenCode config before launching restricted internet-research workers.",
    "Do not commit opencode.json because it may contain local MCP/auth material.",
    "Keep the policy deny-default: do not add ask/default-allow permissions for headless restricted workers.",
    "Use the direct Parallel Search CLI wrapper for discovery and webfetch for exact URL fetching; do not run duplicate generic web-search paths or Parallel MCP discovery in full-run shards.",
    "For now, every internet-research shard must emit a run_profile object or sibling profile JSON with timing, Parallel call counts, usage/token fields when exposed, and explicit unknowns when the tool hides raw usage.",
    "Every citation must be profiled with source_confidence, source_confidence_reason, source_type, and final_evidence_use using docs/methodology/source-confidence-registry.json; low and very_low sources cannot be sole final support.",
    "Restart OpenCode after changing local agent or permission config so the policy is reloaded."
  ]
